window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three rough men who would do anything for me. Except forgive a demon.</p> <p>The five of us are bound together by a curse. The demon's father stole his soul, and we're about to steal it back. I want to believe he'll be a different man when we've stuffed his soul back into his body. My boys are...skeptical. But the four of them share one mother. Ryker. </p> <p>The dangerous warrior with mischief in his eyes. Levi. The sword-swinging killer with the kindest heart. Jacob. The scarred Nephilim with the sarcastic British drawl. And now, the man who is half-demon, half-human. He's a powerful asset to the dark side. Demons can't touch our world without him. He says he wants to live a new life. To be something different.</p> <p>My boys don't want to welcome a demon to the family. But I won't let blood kill blood.</p>"; 
